.Dd June 5, 2026
.Dt OCIFBSD_IMAGE 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm ocifbsd_image
.Nd ocifbsd OCI image management library
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In ocifbsd/image/pull.h
.In ocifbsd/image/push.h
.In ocifbsd/image/unpack.h
.In ocifbsd/image/zfs_store.h
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
library implements the OCI image lifecycle used by
.Xr ocifbsd 8
to pull, unpack, store, and push container images.
It is not a standalone program; it is linked into
the main
.Xr ocifbsd 8
binary and any external tooling that needs to
move images in and out of the local ZFS-backed
image store.
.Pp
The library provides four functional areas:
.Bl -bullet
.It
Registry client
.Pq pull.c
implements OCI Distribution Spec v1.1 pull and push
flows, including bearer-token authentication, manifest
and config fetch, and sha256 layer verification.
.It
Layer unpacker
.Pq unpack.c
extracts gz, bz2, xz, and zstd layer tarballs into
the destination root, with whiteout handling that
matches the OCI image-spec semantics
.Pq .wh. and .wh..wh..opq .
.It
Push pipeline
.Pq push.c
creates layer tarballs from local directories, builds
OCI image manifests, and drives the chunked
cross-mount blob upload protocol.
.It
ZFS storage backend
.Pq zfs_store.c
manages the on-disk dataset layout under
.Pa OCIFBSD_ZFS_IMAGES ,
.Pa OCIFBSD_ZFS_LAYERS ,
and
.Pa OCIFBSD_ZFS_VOLUMES ,
including clone-based layer sharing, snapshots, send
and recv for image migration, and quota accounting.
.El
.Pp
The public API is declared across
.In ocifbsd/image/pull.h ,
.In ocifbsd/image/push.h ,
.In ocifbsd/image/unpack.h ,
and
.In ocifbsd/image/zfs_store.h ;
see those headers for the full list of functions and
data structures.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width /var/db/ocifbsd/images -compact
.It Pa /var/db/ocifbsd/images
Default ZFS dataset for pulled image roots.
.It Pa /var/db/ocifbsd/layers
Default ZFS dataset for shared layer blobs.
.It Pa /var/db/ocifbsd/volumes
Default ZFS dataset for named volumes.
.It Pa /etc/ocifbsd/image.conf
Image configuration (default registry, pull policy).
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr ocifbsd 8 ,
.Xr zfs 8 ,
.Xr libarchive 3 ,
.Xr curl 1 ,
.Xr oci-image-spec 7
.Sh HISTORY
The
.Nm
library first appeared in
.Fx 16.0 .
